{:edb/db-before-t 463 :edb/db-after-t 464 :edb/tx-data [[13194139533776 50 #inst "2026-10-04T22:21:12.248Z" 13194139533776 true] [17592186105639 1020 #edb/ref 17592186250285 13194139533776 true] [17592186105640 1020 #edb/ref 17592186250292 13194139533776 true] [17592186105640 1020 #edb/ref 17592186250306 13194139533776 true] [17592186105644 1020 #edb/ref 17592186250299 13194139533776 true] [17592186105978 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139533776 true] [17592186105978 1145 "First, we apply the constant factor rule and take the coefficient $\\frac{8}{3}$ out of the integral. Then we compute the integral of $\\frac{1}{x},$ and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{8}{3x}\\text{d}x & =\\frac{8}{3}\\int \\frac{1}{x}\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{8}{3}\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x|+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLastly, let's rewrite the constant so that we can combine it with the natural logarithm. For any constant $C,$ we can always write $C=\\frac{8}{3}\\operatorname{ln}⁡K$ where $K$ is some other positive constant. Doing this allows us to combine the constant with $\\frac{8}{3}\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x|$ term, and we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{8}{3x}\\text{d}x & =\\frac{8}{3}\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x|+C \\\\  & =\\frac{8}{3}\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x|+\\frac{8}{3}\\operatorname{ln}⁡K \\\\  & =\\frac{8}{3}(\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x|+\\operatorname{ln}⁡K) \\\\  & =\\frac{8}{3}\\operatorname{ln}⁡(K|x|).\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533776 true] [17592186250285 1017 #edb/ref 17592186250286 13194139533776 true] [17592186250285 1089 "q-103369" 13194139533776 true] [17592186250285 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139533776 true] [17592186250285 1100 "Calculate $\\int \\frac{5}{x}\\,\\text{d}x.$" 13194139533776 true] [17592186250285 1113 #uuid "8fc6231a-b956-5ba4-98e6-075eb6f03f5a" 13194139533776 true] [17592186250285 1145 "First, we apply the constant factor rule and take the coefficient $5$ out of the integral. Then we compute the integral of $\\frac{1}{x},$ and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{5}{x}\\,\\text{d}x & =5\\int \\frac{1}{x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =5\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x|+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533776 true] [17592186250286 1000 #edb/ref 17592186250287 13194139533776 true] [17592186250286 1000 #edb/ref 17592186250288 13194139533776 true] [17592186250286 1000 #edb/ref 17592186250289 13194139533776 true] [17592186250286 1000 #edb/ref 17592186250290 13194139533776 true] [17592186250286 1000 #edb/ref 17592186250291 13194139533776 true] [17592186250286 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533776 true] [17592186250286 1041 "selection" 13194139533776 true] [17592186250286 1104 #edb/ref 17592186250289 13194139533776 true] [17592186250286 1110 #uuid "b0f0d744-84b4-51ea-a1c9-cc96b8478494" 13194139533776 true] [17592186250287 1034 "\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x|}{5}+C" 13194139533776 true] [17592186250287 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533776 true] [17592186250287 1111 #uuid "8aa30e16-fb89-5f63-b2fd-d91407ee49f7" 13194139533776 true] [17592186250288 1034 "5+\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x|+C" 13194139533776 true] [17592186250288 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533776 true] [17592186250288 1111 #uuid "18a0496a-ccc4-5097-9dc8-841e78b4bbf8" 13194139533776 true] [17592186250289 1034 "5\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x|+C" 13194139533776 true] [17592186250289 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533776 true] [17592186250289 1111 #uuid "559d13df-72d2-5cda-b5d2-af330986e8a3" 13194139533776 true] [17592186250290 1034 "\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x|+C" 13194139533776 true] [17592186250290 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533776 true] [17592186250290 1111 #uuid "e908a26f-a0e2-54a0-9278-1432dd5d812e" 13194139533776 true] [17592186250291 1034 "\\frac{5}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x|}+C" 13194139533776 true] [17592186250291 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533776 true] [17592186250291 1111 #uuid "dc97a57e-9fd5-53b8-8e0a-bb353da266a0" 13194139533776 true] [17592186250292 1017 #edb/ref 17592186250293 13194139533776 true] [17592186250292 1089 "q-103593" 13194139533776 true] [17592186250292 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139533776 true] [17592186250292 1100 "Calculate $\\int ({x}^{3/2}+\\frac{1}{2}{x}^{-1})\\,\\text{d}x.$" 13194139533776 true] [17592186250292 1113 #uuid "f6168e0f-95d3-5bb7-aa52-ddc60f3cb1e5" 13194139533776 true] [17592186250292 1145 "First, we apply the sum rule and get\n\n$$\n\\int ({x}^{3/2}+\\frac{1}{2}{x}^{-1})\\,\\text{d}x=\\int {x}^{3/2}\\,\\text{d}x+\\frac{1}{2}\\int \\frac{1}{x}\\,\\text{d}x\n$$\n\nNow, using the power rule in the first term, and taking out the coefficient in the second term, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int {x}^{3/2}\\,\\text{d}x+\\frac{1}{2}\\int \\frac{1}{x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\frac{{x}^{3/2+1}}{\\frac{3}{2}+1}+\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x|+C \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{5}{x}^{5/2}+\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x|+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533776 true] [17592186250293 1000 #edb/ref 17592186250294 13194139533776 true] [17592186250293 1000 #edb/ref 17592186250295 13194139533776 true] [17592186250293 1000 #edb/ref 17592186250296 13194139533776 true] [17592186250293 1000 #edb/ref 17592186250297 13194139533776 true] [17592186250293 1000 #edb/ref 17592186250298 13194139533776 true] [17592186250293 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533776 true] [17592186250293 1041 "selection" 13194139533776 true] [17592186250293 1104 #edb/ref 17592186250298 13194139533776 true] [17592186250293 1110 #uuid "4f7f4c6f-37c5-5504-b65e-fb3646a79d73" 13194139533776 true] [17592186250294 1034 "\\frac{5}{2}{x}^{3/2}+\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x|+C" 13194139533776 true] [17592186250294 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533776 true] [17592186250294 1111 #uuid "f2d6fe6f-8eae-567d-9dea-90b7d5157218" 13194139533776 true] [17592186250295 1034 "\\frac{3}{2}{x}^{5/2}+2\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x|+C" 13194139533776 true] [17592186250295 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533776 true] [17592186250295 1111 #uuid "7668c788-98b3-51e2-bd1a-52cae21b39b7" 13194139533776 true] [17592186250296 1034 "\\frac{3}{2}{x}^{3/2}+2\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x|+C" 13194139533776 true] [17592186250296 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533776 true] [17592186250296 1111 #uuid "1fce1b83-deb1-5ab4-a42c-c41a40c94396" 13194139533776 true] [17592186250297 1034 "\\frac{5}{2}{x}^{5/2}+2\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x|+C" 13194139533776 true] [17592186250297 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533776 true] [17592186250297 1111 #uuid "4be80ff3-1b3b-5e71-b2e9-1371b757622e" 13194139533776 true] [17592186250298 1034 "\\frac{2}{5}{x}^{5/2}+\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x|+C" 13194139533776 true] [17592186250298 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533776 true] [17592186250298 1111 #uuid "a7408c64-3fb6-5a07-9cd4-7f0ab853ebce" 13194139533776 true] [17592186250299 1017 #edb/ref 17592186250300 13194139533776 true] [17592186250299 1089 "q-103605" 13194139533776 true] [17592186250299 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139533776 true] [17592186250299 1100 "What is the antiderivative of $\\frac{2x-1}{x}?$" 13194139533776 true] [17592186250299 1113 #uuid "de38dc2b-38ee-5deb-9b32-6e4c664420c5" 13194139533776 true] [17592186250299 1145 "We separate the integrand into the sum of two fractions so that we can simplify each term. So, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{2x-1}{x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int (\\frac{2x}{x}-\\frac{1}{x})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int (2-\\frac{1}{x})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2\\int \\,\\text{d}x-\\int \\frac{1}{x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2x-\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x|+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLastly, let's rewrite the constant so that we can combine it with the natural logarithm. For any constant $C,$ we can always write $C=-\\operatorname{ln}⁡K$ where $K$ is some other positive constant. Doing this allows us to combine the constant with $-\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x|$ term, and we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{2x-1}{x}\\,\\text{d}x & =2x-\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x|+C \\\\  & =2x-\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x|-\\operatorname{ln}⁡K \\\\  & =2x-(\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x|+\\operatorname{ln}⁡K) \\\\  & =2x-\\operatorname{ln}⁡(K|x|).\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533776 true] [17592186250300 1000 #edb/ref 17592186250301 13194139533776 true] [17592186250300 1000 #edb/ref 17592186250302 13194139533776 true] [17592186250300 1000 #edb/ref 17592186250303 13194139533776 true] [17592186250300 1000 #edb/ref 17592186250304 13194139533776 true] [17592186250300 1000 #edb/ref 17592186250305 13194139533776 true] [17592186250300 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533776 true] [17592186250300 1041 "selection" 13194139533776 true] [17592186250300 1104 #edb/ref 17592186250301 13194139533776 true] [17592186250300 1110 #uuid "82405685-59a1-5e2c-a847-3310686c49d1" 13194139533776 true] [17592186250301 1034 "2x-\\operatorname{ln}⁡(K|x|)" 13194139533776 true] [17592186250301 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533776 true] [17592186250301 1111 #uuid "8a978206-6017-5bd1-8b0e-72c43b05fbae" 13194139533776 true] [17592186250302 1034 "{x}^{2}+\\operatorname{ln}⁡(K|x|)" 13194139533776 true] [17592186250302 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533776 true] [17592186250302 1111 #uuid "9c1f87c6-0ec1-5d29-9b42-93b4b1eedba3" 13194139533776 true] [17592186250303 1034 "2x+\\operatorname{ln}⁡(|x|+K)" 13194139533776 true] [17592186250303 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533776 true] [17592186250303 1111 #uuid "1e0b6d48-31b3-57cc-ba54-4810982c2af7" 13194139533776 true] [17592186250304 1034 "2x+\\operatorname{ln}⁡(K|x|)" 13194139533776 true] [17592186250304 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533776 true] [17592186250304 1111 #uuid "f230377c-ba24-53bb-a49a-77160503441d" 13194139533776 true] [17592186250305 1034 "{x}^{2}-\\operatorname{ln}⁡(K|x|)" 13194139533776 true] [17592186250305 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533776 true] [17592186250305 1111 #uuid "5cfa26b9-e523-5a59-af88-a097ff241327" 13194139533776 true] [17592186250306 1017 #edb/ref 17592186250307 13194139533776 true] [17592186250306 1089 "q-29885" 13194139533776 true] [17592186250306 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139533776 true] [17592186250306 1100 "Calculate $\\int ({x}^{2/3}+\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{x})\\,\\text{d}x.$" 13194139533776 true] [17592186250306 1113 #uuid "a1fd3399-f36e-569b-89f9-d06cadb048a9" 13194139533776 true] [17592186250306 1145 "First, we apply the sum rule and get\n\n$$\n\\int ({x}^{2/3}+\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{x})\\,\\text{d}x=\\int {x}^{2/3}\\,\\text{d}x+\\sqrt{2}\\int \\frac{1}{x}\\,\\text{d}x\n$$\n\nNow, using the power rule in the first term, and taking out the coefficient in the second term, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int {x}^{2/3}\\,\\text{d}x+\\sqrt{2}\\int \\frac{1}{x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\frac{{x}^{2/3+1}}{\\frac{2}{3}+1}+\\sqrt{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x|+C \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{5}{x}^{5/3}+\\sqrt{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x|+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533776 true] [17592186250307 1000 #edb/ref 17592186250308 13194139533776 true] [17592186250307 1000 #edb/ref 17592186250309 13194139533776 true] [17592186250307 1000 #edb/ref 17592186250310 13194139533776 true] [17592186250307 1000 #edb/ref 17592186250311 13194139533776 true] [17592186250307 1000 #edb/ref 17592186250312 13194139533776 true] [17592186250307 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533776 true] [17592186250307 1041 "selection" 13194139533776 true] [17592186250307 1104 #edb/ref 17592186250312 13194139533776 true] [17592186250307 1110 #uuid "b0da6736-bbca-5bea-9f9b-514f7721c773" 13194139533776 true] [17592186250308 1034 "\\frac{3\\operatorname{ln}⁡x}{5}{x}^{5/3}+\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x|+C" 13194139533776 true] [17592186250308 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533776 true] [17592186250308 1111 #uuid "9cdd1613-c193-5531-b4b3-85a2b86f8aa1" 13194139533776 true] [17592186250309 1034 "\\frac{7}{5}{x}^{4/3}+2\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x|+C" 13194139533776 true] [17592186250309 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533776 true] [17592186250309 1111 #uuid "fe940d4c-1be7-5233-beb3-e7ec924193be" 13194139533776 true] [17592186250310 1034 "\\frac{11}{5}{x}^{11/3}+\\sqrt{5}\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x|+C" 13194139533776 true] [17592186250310 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533776 t